+```bash
+# Windows (Developer PowerShell, cmake on PATH). The host configures and builds into Exhibits/GeometryProcessing/Code/build on first start.
+python Exhibits/GeometryProcessing/Code/Tooling/InspectionHost.py
+# open http://localhost:8740
+
+# Linux sandbox (cmake and ninja from the scratch venv)
+V=_ClaudeScratch/.venv/bin
+python3 Exhibits/GeometryProcessing/Code/Tooling/InspectionHost.py --cmake $V/cmake --generator Ninja --make-program $V/ninja
+
