+expect knife-inserts > 7
+key Escape
+frames 2
+expect knife == 0
+
+# ⑦ Object mode: pick the cube (its +x face, clear of the gizmo), Shift-pick the insert body, Shift+K, K keeps the cutter, Enter cuts 0.0192 out of the cube
+key 4
+frames 1
+click world 1.0 -0.5 0.6
+frames 2
+click world -0.5 -0.5 2.02 Left Shift
+frames 2
