+frames 6
+capture 274KnifeObject
+key Enter
+frames 3
+expect refused == 0
+expect knife-commits == 6
+expect bodies == 2
+expect volume ~ 7.541828330588459
+expect sound == 1
+
+# ⑧ the toolbar cutter menu (beside the knife icon): Rectangle opens the knife drawing a rectangle; 0.4 × 0.4 on the top
+#    face (T back to depth: Through is remembered from ③) cut 0.1 deep removes 0.016; the menu remembers it (Shift+K starts a rectangle), Insert / Object switch modes,
