+frames 6
+expect knife-depth > 0.55
+expect knife-depth < 0.65
+expect knife-refusal == 0
+capture 282KnifeCutterDimensions
+key Escape
+frames 3
+expect knife == 0
+expect volume ~ 7.525828330588459
+
+# ⑩ a knife line slices: Line from the cutter menu, two clicks across the top face (x −0.9, edge to edge) finish it; an
+#    open chain has no inside, so the knife splits the cube along the sheet the line sweeps through it (one more body,
+#    the volume unchanged); depth / T / the Boolean do not apply, so moving the pointer never restages; Enter adopts
+#    the staged preview; afterwards faces and bodies select and edit as before (a face pick, an Esc, a fillet)
+click @SketchKnifeTool
+frames 3
+click @KnifeToolLine
+frames 3
+expect knife == 1
+expect knife-pending == 1
+expect drawing == Line
+move world -0.9 -0.98 2.0
