+expect knife-commits == 12
+
+# ⑬ 3D cutters, drawn as the Construct menu's primitives (base on the face, then the height into the body with live
+#    dimension lines; the cut stages behind the outline as it is pulled). A fresh 2 m cube (volume 8):
+#    box 0.4 × 0.4 pulled 0.3 into the top face = 0.048 → 7.952 · cylinder r 0.2 pulled 0.5 in, cutter kept (K):
+#    −0.02π for the hole, +0.0208π for the kept cutter (0.5 + the 0.02 knife lift above the face) → 7.952 + 0.0008π ·
+#    a sphere centred on the +x face cuts a half ball (right-click is its rim)
+key Escape
+frames 2
