+# A closed Hermite profile extruded 1 has an exact ruled NURBS side; C cuts it at x = 0.8 and X removes the left piece, so
+# the top rim becomes an open spline edge between the wall and the top cap. B then blends that rim: a chamfer (ball law on
+# extended supports), a variable fillet 0.1 → 0.25, and an honest refusal past the wall's curvature radius.
