+key I Ctrl Shift
+frames 3
+click @PathImport
+frames 3
+expect steps == 11
+click @ViewMenu
+frames 2
+click @ViewIsometric
+frames 2
+key Space
+frames 3
+key 1
+frames 2
+move world 0.50298 0.41799 0.81056
+frames 2
+press Left
+frames 1
+move offset 0 -10
+frames 2
+release Left
+frames 3
+expect pole-edits == 1
+expect status contains Moved pole 2 of Section3
+click world 0.375 0.0 0.75875
+click world 0.375 0.187 0.7888 Left Shift
+click world 0.375 0.418 0.81925 Left Shift
+frames 2
+click @LoftG0
+frames 1
+expect loft-continuity == 0
