+click @DisplayMenu
+frames 2
+click @ZebraToggle
+frames 3
+expect zebra == 1
+expect triangles > 1500
+expect status contains Zebra on
+click @ViewMenu
+frames 2
+click @ViewTop
+frames 3
+capture 70ZebraG0
+
+# ② undo the rear loft, redo it G2: the stripes no longer kink at Section3
+key Z Ctrl
+frames 3
+expect panels == 1
+click world 0.375 0.418 0.81925
+click world 0.375 0.66 0.84171 Left Shift
+click world 0.375 0.891 0.85404 Left Shift
+click world 0.375 1.1 0.85875 Left Shift
+frames 2
+click @LoftG2
+frames 1
+expect loft-continuity == 2
+key L
+frames 3
+expect steps == 13
+expect refused == 0
+expect panels == 2
+expect sound == 1
+expect status contains · G2
+key Escape
+frames 1
+expect zebra == 1
+click @ViewMenu
+frames 2
+click @ViewTop
+frames 3
+capture 71ZebraG2
+
+# ③ deviation map: zebra off, needles on (magnified; the legend states the factor)
+click @DisplayMenu
+frames 2
