+# drag reshapes Section3 and the sheet follows; undo / redo; the sheet renders from both sides.
+# Run: SolidArcCapture --specimen --reset-files --recovery …/VehicleRecovery.solidarc
+#      --document …/Vehicle.solidarc --script Scripts/VehicleSurfacingWalkthrough.txt
+# Click points lie on the analytic bonnet H(ξ, η) at ξ = 0.5 (x = 0.375), the sections at η {0, 0.17, 0.38, 0.6, 0.81, 1};
+# the dragged pole is pole 2 of Section3 at (0.50298, 0.41799, 0.81056) (the fit of the sample file).
+
+# Placement snapped to the 0.1 grid, as these checks were written for (free placement is the default since ⑮ of Snapping).
