+frames 2
+expect selected-curves == Section1
+expect focused-caption == Section1
+key L
+frames 2
+expect status contains at least 2
+expect steps == 11
+
+# ③ Shift+click adds the sections in loft order (badges 1 … 6, curvature combs on the selected curves)
+click world 0.375 0.187 0.7888 Left Shift
+click world 0.375 0.418 0.81925 Left Shift
