+frames 2
+expect selected-curves == Section1,Section2,Section4,Section5,Section6
+click world 0.375 0.418 0.81925 Left Shift
+frames 2
+expect selected-curves == Section1,Section2,Section4,Section5,Section6,Section3
+click world 0.375 0.418 0.81925 Left Ctrl
+click world 0.375 0.66 0.84171 Left Ctrl
+click world 0.375 0.891 0.85404 Left Ctrl
+click world 0.375 1.1 0.85875 Left Ctrl
+click world 0.375 0.418 0.81925 Left Shift
+click world 0.375 0.66 0.84171 Left Shift
+click world 0.375 0.891 0.85404 Left Shift
+click world 0.375 1.1 0.85875 Left Shift
+frames 2
+expect selected-curves == Section1,Section2,Section3,Section4,Section5,Section6
+capture 52SectionsSelected
+
+# ④ L lofts the selection: one open NURBS sheet, sound audit, the curve selection is consumed
+key L
+frames 3
