+key Escape
+frames 1
+release Left
+frames 2
+expect pole-drag-active == 0
+expect pole-drags == 0
+expect pole-edits == 0
+expect undo == 2
+
+# ⑥ mode 1 pole drag: press on pole 2 of Section3, drag up, the curve previews live (green), the release regenerates
+#    the loft; Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Shift+Z remove and reapply the edit
+move world 0.50298 0.41799 0.81056
+frames 2
+press Left
