+expect status contains Moved pole 2 of Section3
+click world 0.06 0.418 0.84268
+frames 2
+expect selected-curves == Section3
+capture 55PoleMoved
+key Z Ctrl
+frames 3
+expect pole-edits == 0
+expect sheet == 1
+expect redo == 1
+key Z Ctrl Shift
+frames 3
+expect pole-edits == 1
+expect redo == 0
